{%- comment -%}
  Renders the mobile accordion links for a mega menu item (links ported from the live theme).
  Outputs nothing when the item has no mega links, so the menu's own sub-links are used.

  Accepts:
  - handle: {String} Handleized top-level link title, e.g. 'headlamps' (required)

  Usage:
  {% render 'nav-mega-mobile-links', handle: mega_handle %}
{%- endcomment -%}
